# Shared native/WASM parity scenario (TFIXU 4, tests #3). Both surfaces run this one file:
#   build/host/x0x_host tests/parity.x0x build/host   ->  build/host/emu_ref.wav
#   node tests/host/emu_test.mjs build/emu/x0x.wasm build/host/emu_ref.wav tests/parity.x0x
# so the same gestures happen at the same simulated times on the device and in the browser.
# The boot song is the Starter template: start the transport, then launch a drum clip (a
# non-silent signal through the clip engine).
wav emu_ref.wav
wait 500
tap PLAY
wait 200
tapkey 0
wait 2760
wavstop
